          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_GzmteL": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q1. 沒有滑過雪也可以參加嗎？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 12
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_L4iY7c": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>完全沒問題！我們的課程專為初學者設計，即使是第一次踩上雪板也能放心參加。教練會從裝備穿戴、安全姿勢到滑行基礎，一步步帶著你學，不用擔心跟不上。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_L4iY7c"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_YrXtFQ": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q2　課程進行的語言是什麼？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_rBYdVi": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>我們提供中文、英文及廣東話教學，你可以在報名時備註偏好的語言，教練將以最適合你的方式溝通，讓學習更輕鬆自在。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_rBYdVi"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_bbM3bL": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q3　課程會不會太累？我體力不太好可以嗎？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Df6GNk": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>單板（Snowboard）初學者會比較需要核心與大腿肌力，學習過程相對消耗體力；雙板（Ski）則較適合親子同行或體力一般的學習者。不論選擇哪種，我們都會依照每位學員的狀況調整節奏，不會強迫你撐過極限。隨時覺得需要休息都可以說，安全和體驗品質是我們最重視的事。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Df6GNk"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_iCmNz8": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q4　有年齡限制嗎？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 50
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_tKAcPz": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>建議參加年齡為 6 歲以上。6～12 歲的孩童建議報名 1 對 1 私人課程；若希望親子同班，課程將以帶領小朋友體驗為主。若同行超過 1 位孩童，則需安排 2 位教練陪同。有小朋友要一起參加的話，請事先與我們聯繫確認，讓我們幫你安排最合適的方式。。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_tKAcPz"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_LGdXA4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q5　課程在哪裡上？交通方便嗎？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_J3c7Fw": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>我們主要服務北海道富良野、星野（Tomamu）滑雪場，另外旭川神居、聖誕禮物公園滑雪場也可以安排課程，歡迎事先與我們確認。<br/></p><p>前往富良野的交通方式：<br/>**HOKKAIDO RESORT LINER 巴士**：雪季期間可從新千歲機場直接搭乘，前往富良野飯店及車站，車程約 2～3 小時，需事先預約。詳情請參考官方網站：<a href=\"https://www.access-n.jp/winter2025/en/skibus/detail/chitose_furano.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"HOKKAIDO RESORT LINER 巴士\">https://www.access-n.jp/winter2025/en/skibus/detail/chitose_furano.html</a><br/><br/>**JR 鐵路**：路線為新千歲機場／札幌 → 瀧川 → 富良野，車程約 3～4 小時，班次較彈性，適合行程不固定的旅客。</p><p>- **民宿接駁**：預訂我們的<br/>CHILL STAY 民宿(籌備中)，可免費提供富良野車站到民宿的接駁服務（需事先預約）。</p><p> 完成報名後，我們也會提供詳細的行前交通資訊。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_J3c7Fw"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_xpJXPp": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q6　課程費用包含哪些內容？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_ycxGcQ": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>課程費用包含教學服務及責任保險。滑雪裝備需自行準備或另行租借。</p><p>我們提供優惠的單板裝備租賃服務（僅限成人），建議先與我們諮詢確認需求後，再至官方網站完成租賃預訂，方便我們提前為你準備。若你希望自行租借，我們也可以提供推薦店鋪清單與租賃優惠資訊。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_ycxGcQ"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_zBhX4c": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q7　課程可以自由選日期嗎？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_GEkeCd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>可以！建議先與我們聯繫確認日期是否可以安排，再至官網選擇日期與課程時段完成預訂，確保你的行程順利銜接。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_GEkeCd"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_y6zcRn": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q8　如果天氣不好或雪場沒開怎麼辦？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_xpVzRw": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>若遇天候不佳導致雪場纜車運休或其他不可抗力因素，我們會主動通知並協助安排延期，或提供全額退款。</p><p>若天候不佳但雪場纜車仍正常運行，我們會視時間狀況協助協調改期。若因個人因素需要取消，則依照我們的退款政策處理，詳情請參閱官網退款政策頁面。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_xpVzRw"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_6FJg3w": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Q9　臨時無法出席，可以退費或轉讓嗎？",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jN68hd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>課程可免費轉讓一次給其他人，請於出發前告知我們更新學員資料即可。若確實因不可抗力因素無法成行，我們會協助評估改期或部分退款，請直接聯繫我們討論。</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
